  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/xHjyKu7U4m6kDG8h9te7-4KJTE2WbGz8ldaOGT_X5fI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { if } \\arg (z)=-\\pi+\\theta \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\arg (\\bar{z})=\\pi-\\theta \\\\\n& \\arg (-\\bar{z})=-\\theta \\\\\n& \\arg (\\bar{z})-\\arg (-\\bar{z})=\\pi-\\theta-(-\\theta)=\\pi-\\theta+\\theta=\\pi\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
